This license governs the SAVANT FRAMEWORK core repository (`savant-core`) and its
satellite repositories (`clai-os`, `aegis-ng`, `aegis-global`, `grants`),
including the SPOS v1.0 six-layer fractal prompt architecture, the SIP v1.0
invocation protocol, the S50 Absolute Governance Engine, the twelve load-bearing
