## Falsifiability Test

Test: Present a deployment scenario — (a) a commercial SaaS operator serving
CLAI-OS over a network without a CAA, (b) a sovereign health authority
manufacturing AEGIS-NG units domestically for free distribution, and (c) a
licensee filing patent suit against the project — and ask whether this
LICENSE unambiguously determines the licensing position of each party.
Expected result: (a) unlicensed/AGPL-violating; (b) fee-exempt under
Section 5; (c) patent rights terminated under Section 4 while copyright
obligations persist. If any of the three scenarios yields an ambiguous
answer from the text alone, this document fails its enforceability claim.
